cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "pyssp_sysml2"
abstract: >-
  Generate SSD, SSV, SSM, analysis, SSP, and SysML artifacts from a SysML v2
  architecture or SSD. The SysML dialect comes from pycps_sysml2; FMI
  artifacts come from pyfmi_sysml2.
authors:
  - name: "Erik Rosenlund"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-4238-3271"
  - name: "pyssp contributors"
date-released: "2026-11-05"
version: "0.4.0"
license: "MIT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/pyssporg/pyssp_sysml2"
keywords:
  - SysML v2
  - SSP
  - SSD
  - model-based systems engineering
